            "content_md": "數列記作 $\\langle a_n\\rangle$，$a_1$ 為首項，$a_n$ 為第 $n$ 項。項的位置是資料的一部分。"
          },
          {
            "id": "concept-own-math2-1-1-c01-b2",
            "position": 1,
            "block_type": "method",
            "title": "雙向轉換",
            "content_md": "已知 $a_n$ 時依序代入 $n=1,2,\\ldots$；由前幾項找一般項時，分別檢查差、比、符號、分子分母及週期。"
          },
          {
            "id": "concept-own-math2-1-1-c01-b3",
            "position": 2,
            "block_type": "warning",
            "title": "索引起點",
            "content_md": "外觀相似的公式可能因 $n$、$n-1$ 或 $n+1$ 而表示不同數列；猜得公式後必須回代前幾項。"
          }
        ],
        "created_at": "2026-07-27T18:27:29.474Z",
        "updated_at": "2026-07-27T18:39:52.155Z"
      },
      {
        "skeleton_id": "1-1-C02",
        "id": "concept-own-math2-1-1-c02",
        "grade_id": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
        "unit_id": "unit-math2-ch1-1-1",
        "title": "等差數列、一般項與參數反求",
        "summary_md": "相鄰差固定的數列為等差數列，可由任兩項反求首項與公差。",
        "status": "reviewed",
        "visibility": "private",
        "created_by_auth_type": "codex",
        "created_by_key_name": "original-lecture-authoring",
        "created_by_label": "本機原創講義",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "id": "concept-own-math2-1-1-c02-b1",
            "position": 0,
            "block_type": "definition",
            "title": "固定差",
            "content_md": "若 $a_{n+1}-a_n=d$，則 $\\langle a_n\\rangle$ 為公差 $d$ 的等差數列。"
          },
          {
            "id": "concept-own-math2-1-1-c02-b2",
            "position": 1,
            "block_type": "formula",
            "title": "一般項",
            "content_md": "$$a_n=a_1+(n-1)d,\\qquad a_q-a_p=(q-p)d.$$"
          },
          {
            "id": "concept-own-math2-1-1-c02-b3",
            "position": 2,
            "block_type": "method",
            "title": "臨界項",
            "content_md": "求「從第幾項開始為正或負」時，先解嚴格不等式，再取符合條件的最小正整數。"
          }
        ],
        "created_at": "2026-07-27T18:27:29.474Z",
        "updated_at": "2026-07-27T18:39:52.155Z"
      },
      {
        "skeleton_id": "1-1-C03",
        "id": "concept-own-math2-1-1-c03",
        "grade_id": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
        "unit_id": "unit-math2-ch1-1-1",
        "title": "等差中項與插項",
        "summary_md": "等距索引的等差數列具有對稱關係；插項時要先數清楚間隔數。",
        "status": "reviewed",
        "visibility": "private",
        "created_by_auth_type": "codex",
        "created_by_key_name": "original-lecture-authoring",
        "created_by_label": "本機原創講義",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "id": "concept-own-math2-1-1-c03-b1",
            "position": 0,
            "block_type": "formula",
            "title": "等差中項",
            "content_md": "若 $a,b,c$ 成等差數列，則 $2b=a+c$。"
          },
          {
            "id": "concept-own-math2-1-1-c03-b2",
            "position": 1,
            "block_type": "method",
            "title": "插入中項",
            "content_md": "在兩端點間插入 $m$ 個等差中項時，共有 $m+1$ 個間隔。"
          },
          {
            "id": "concept-own-math2-1-1-c03-b3",
            "position": 2,
            "block_type": "note",
            "title": "對稱項",
            "content_md": "若索引到中央項的距離相同，則 $a_{m-r}+a_{m+r}=2a_m$。"
          }
        ],
        "created_at": "2026-07-27T18:27:29.474Z",
        "updated_at": "2026-07-27T18:39:52.155Z"
      },
      {
        "skeleton_id": "1-1-C04",
        "id": "concept-own-math2-1-1-c04",
        "grade_id": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
        "unit_id": "unit-math2-ch1-1-1",
        "title": "等比數列、一般項、中項與參數反求",
        "summary_md": "相鄰比固定的非零數列為等比數列；反求公比時須處理正負根與符號條件。",
        "status": "reviewed",
        "visibility": "private",
        "created_by_auth_type": "codex",
        "created_by_key_name": "original-lecture-authoring",
        "created_by_label": "本機原創講義",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "id": "concept-own-math2-1-1-c04-b1",
            "position": 0,
            "block_type": "definition",
            "title": "固定比",
            "content_md": "若各項及 $r$ 均非零，且 $\\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n}=r$，則為公比 $r$ 的等比數列。"
          },
          {
            "id": "concept-own-math2-1-1-c04-b2",
            "position": 1,
            "block_type": "formula",
            "title": "一般項與中項",
            "content_md": "$$a_n=a_1r^{n-1},\\qquad \\frac{a_q}{a_p}=r^{q-p},\\qquad b^2=ac.$$"
          },
          {
            "id": "concept-own-math2-1-1-c04-b3",
            "position": 2,
            "block_type": "warning",
            "title": "正負根",
            "content_md": "由偶次方求 $r$ 時原則上有正、負兩根，必須用正項、單調或順序條件篩選。"
          }
        ],
        "created_at": "2026-07-27T18:27:29.474Z",
        "updated_at": "2026-07-27T18:39:52.155Z"
      },
      {
        "skeleton_id": "1-1-C05",
        "id": "concept-own-math2-1-1-c05",
        "grade_id": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
        "unit_id": "unit-math2-ch1-1-1",
        "title": "混合條件與新數列性質",
        "summary_md": "等差、等比混合題先分別代數化；數列運算後的性質必須回到差或比檢查。",
        "status": "reviewed",
        "visibility": "private",
        "created_by_auth_type": "codex",
        "created_by_key_name": "original-lecture-authoring",
        "created_by_label": "本機原創講義",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "id": "concept-own-math2-1-1-c05-b1",
            "position": 0,
            "block_type": "method",
            "title": "混合條件",
            "content_md": "先寫出 $2b=a+c$ 與 $b^2=ac$ 等關係，再聯立並檢查零值、正負與順序。"
          },
          {
            "id": "concept-own-math2-1-1-c05-b2",
            "position": 1,
            "block_type": "method",
            "title": "新數列",
            "content_md": "判斷新數列是否等差，計算相鄰差；判斷是否等比，計算相鄰比。"
          },
          {
            "id": "concept-own-math2-1-1-c05-b3",
            "position": 2,
            "block_type": "warning",
            "title": "反例",
            "content_md": "少數特例成立不能推出一般結論；錯誤敘述應以符合原條件的反例否定。"
          }
        ],
        "created_at": "2026-07-27T18:27:29.474Z",
        "updated_at": "2026-07-27T18:39:52.155Z"
      },
      {
