        "title": "累加型與累乘型遞迴",
        "summary_md": "相鄰差可逐式相加，相鄰比可逐式相乘，並利用中間項消去。",
        "status": "reviewed",
        "visibility": "private",
        "created_by_auth_type": "codex",
        "created_by_key_name": "original-lecture-authoring",
        "created_by_label": "本機原創講義",
        "blocks": [
