            "title": "單利模型",
            "content_md": "本金為 $P$、每期利率為 $r$ 時，第 $n$ 期末本利和為 $A_n=P(1+nr)$。"
          },
          {
            "id": "concept-own-math2-1-1-c14-b2",
            "position": 1,
            "block_type": "method",
            "title": "反推利率",
