            "id": "concept-own-math2-1-1-c09-b1",
            "position": 0,
            "block_type": "method",
            "title": "建模步驟",
            "content_md": "定義 $a_n$ 的計數對象，列出 $a_1,a_2,a_3$，比較 $a_n-a_{n-1}$ 或 $\\frac{a_n}{a_{n-1}}$，最後寫出含初始值的遞迴式。"
          },
          {
            "id": "concept-own-math2-1-1-c09-b2",
