        "title": "歸納法的邏輯結構與證明診斷",
        "summary_md": "數學歸納法由起始步與可傳遞的歸納步共同構成。",
        "status": "reviewed",
        "visibility": "private",
        "created_by_auth_type": "codex",
        "created_by_key_name": "original-lecture-authoring",
        "created_by_label": "本機原創講義",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "id": "concept-own-math2-1-1-c10-b1",
            "position": 0,
            "block_type": "method",
            "title": "四段書寫",
            "content_md": "驗證起始值；假設 $n=k$ 成立；使用該假設證明 $n=k+1$；寫出對指定範圍成立的結論。"
          },
          {
            "id": "concept-own-math2-1-1-c10-b2",
            "position": 1,
            "block_type": "warning",
            "title": "必須使用假設",
            "content_md": "只分別寫出第 k 與第 k+1 個式子，或只驗算數個值，都不是完整歸納證明。"
          }
        ],
        "created_at": "2026-07-27T18:27:29.474Z",
        "updated_at": "2026-07-29T09:44:58.208Z"
      },
      {
