        "title": "單利與等差型成長",
        "summary_md": "單利只以原始本金計息，每期增加量固定，因此本利和形成等差數列。",
        "status": "reviewed",
        "visibility": "private",
        "created_by_auth_type": "codex",
        "created_by_key_name": "original-lecture-authoring",
        "created_by_label": "本機原創講義",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "id": "concept-own-math2-1-1-c14-b1",
            "position": 0,
            "block_type": "formula",
            "title": "單利模型",
            "content_md": "本金為 $P$、每期利率為 $r$ 時，第 $n$ 期末本利和為 $A_n=P(1+nr)$。"
          },
          {
            "id": "concept-own-math2-1-1-c14-b2",
            "position": 1,
            "block_type": "method",
            "title": "反推利率",
            "content_md": "先以總利息 $A_n-P$ 除以期數，得到每期利息，再除以本金求 $r$。"
          },
          {
            "id": "concept-own-math2-1-1-c14-b3",
            "position": 2,
            "block_type": "warning",
            "title": "計息基礎",
            "content_md": "單利每期都以原始本金計息，不把前期利息併入下一期本金。"
          }
        ],
        "created_at": "2026-07-29T06:36:43.236Z",
        "updated_at": "2026-07-29T09:44:58.208Z"
